e":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#get-update-or-delete-a-topic","content":"Deleting a topic deletes its opt-outs; those addresses become eligible for that mail again."},"1815":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-70","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topic-opt-outs-members","content":"`GET` returns `{ email, createdAt }` rows (paginated with `page` and `limit`). `POST` opts an address out (idempotent, returns `201`). `DELETE` removes the opt-out. The older paths `/suppression-groups/{id}/suppressions`, `/suppressions/{email}` and `/suppressions/bulk` remain available."},"1816":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-71","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"| Field | Type   | Description                   |\n| ----- | ------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | Unique suppression identifier |","table":"table-8"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-72","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"| Field   | Type   | Description              |\n| ------- | ------ | ------------------------ |\n| `email` | string | Suppressed email address |","table":"table-8"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-73","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"| Field    | Type   | Description                                      |\n| -------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reason` | string | `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual` |","table":"table-8"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-74","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"| Field     | Type           | Description       |\n| --------- | -------------- | ----------------- |\n| `details` | object \\| null | Free-form details |","table":"table-8"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-75","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"| Field       | Type   | Description                 |\n| ----------- | ------ | --------------------------- |\n| `createdAt` | string | ISO 8601 creation timestamp |","table":"table-8"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"page","content":"Templates API","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","API Reference"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/templates"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-0","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates","content":"Legacy template API (deprecated, sunset 30 April 2027). Use the Studio designs API."},"1823":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-1","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#templates-api","content":"Templates API"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-2","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#list-templates","content":"List Templates"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-3","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#query-parameters","content":"Query Parameters"},"1826":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-4","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#example-request","content":"Example Request"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-5","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","type":"heading