":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-46","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event               | Description                   | Trigger                                 |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `contact.confirmed` | A double opt-in was confirmed | Recipient clicked the confirmation link |","table":"table-0"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-47","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event                  | Description                                             | Trigger                                                           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `contact.unsubscribed` | Someone unsubscribed from everything, a list or a topic | Unsubscribe link, one-click, preference centre, Subscriptions API |","table":"table-0"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-48","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event               | Description             | Trigger                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list.member_added` | A contact joined a list | Subscriptions API, list member API, preference centre (signup forms report the list in `contact.subscribed` instead) |","table":"table-0"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-49","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","c