,"url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                        |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | string | Yes      | HTTPS endpoint URL that will receive POST requests |","table":"table-1"},"1954":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-56","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type     | Required | Description             |\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | ----------------------- |\n| `events` | string[] | Yes      | One or more event types |","table":"table-1"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-57","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body","content":"| Field         | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ------------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `description` | string | No       | Up to 500 characters |","table":"table-1"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-58","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#example-response-1","content":"Save the `secret` value -- you will need it to verify webhook signatures. The secret is only returned in the create response."},"1957":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-59","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#update-webhook","content":"Update an existing webhook endpoint."},"1958":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-60","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body-1","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------- |\n| `url` | string | No       | New endpoint URL |","table":"table-2"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-61","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body-1","content":"| Field    | Type     | Required | Description                 |\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | --------------------------- |\n| `events` | string[] | No       | Updated event subscriptions |","table":"table-2"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-62","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body-1","content":"| Field         | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ------------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `description` | string | No       | Up to 500 characters |","table":"table-2"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-63","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body-1","content":"| Field    | Type    | Required | Description                   |\n| -------- | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `active` | boolean | No       | Enable or disable the webhook |","table":"table-2"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-64","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body-1","content":"Returns `{ \"webhook\": { ... }, \"message\": \"Webhook updated successfully\" }`."},"1963":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-65","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#delete-webhook","content":"Remove a webhook endpoint. No further events will be delivered."},"1964":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-66","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#get-webhook","content":"Returns `{ \"webhook\": { ... }, \"stats\": { \"totalDeliveries\", \"successfulDeliveries\", \"successRate\" } }`, with delivery stats for the last 24 hours."},"1965":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-67","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#rotate-secret","content":"The new secret is shown once. For one hour, until `previousSecretValidUntil`, deliveries also carry `X-NorthRelay-Signature-Previous`, signed with the old secret, so you can deploy the new secret without dropping events."},"1966":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-68","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#test-webhook","content":"Sends a test event (body `{ \"eventType\": \"<event type>\" }`, default `email.delivered`) to an active webhook and reports the result:"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-69","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#test-webhook","content":"When the endpoint cannot be reached, `success` is `false`, `statusCode` is `0` and `errorMessage` says why."},"1968":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-70","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#sdk","content":"See the TypeScript SDK and Python SDK for details."},"1969":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-71","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"Every webhook is an HTTP `POST` with a JSON body. All events share this envelope:"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-72","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field       | Type   | Description                                                           |\n| ----------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `eventType` | string | One of the event types. Also sent in the `X-NorthRelay-Event` header. |","table":"table-3"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-73","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field       | Type   | Description                                                                                                         |\n| ----------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `messageId` | string | For `email.*` delivery events, the message id. For contact, list and engagement events, a unique id for this event. |","table":"table-3"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-74","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field       | Type   | Description                           |\n| ----------- | ------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| `timestamp` | string | ISO 8601 time the event was generated |","table":"table-3"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-75","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field       | Type   | Description                                       |\n| ----------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `recipient` | string | Recipient (or contact) address, when there is one |","table":"table-3"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-76","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field    | Type   | Description                                |\n| -------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `sender` | string | Sender address (`email.*` delivery events) |","table":"table-3"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-77","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#payload-format","content":"| Field     | Type   | Description                              |\n| ---