server#tool-groups","content":"| Group            | Tools                                                                                 | Description                |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **suppressions** | `list_suppressions`, `add_suppression`, `remove_suppression`, `bulk_add_suppressions` | Account-level suppressions |","table":"table-2"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-94","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#tool-groups","content":"| Group                  | Tools                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                | Description                                                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **suppression_groups** | `list_suppression_groups`, `get_suppression_group`, `create_suppression_group`, `update_suppression_group`, `delete_suppression_group`, `list_suppression_group_members`, `add_suppression_group_member`, `remove_suppression_group_member`, `bulk_update_suppression_group_members` | Topics and their opt-outs (a member is an address that opted out) |","table":"table-2"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-95","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#tool-groups","content":"| Group        | Tools                                                                 