s`, `update_ip_warmup` | IPs and warmup |","table":"table-2"},"3969":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-99","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#tool-groups","content":"The contact, subscription, topic and form tools return structured content and carry MCP annotations (read-only, destructive, idempotent). Their errors keep the API `code`, `status` and `fix_action`."},"3970":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-100","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#usage-examples","content":"Once configured, interact with NorthRelay through natural language in your AI client."},"3971":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-101","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#sending-emails","content":"> \"Send a welcome email to jane@example.com with the subject 'Welcome to our platform' and an HTML body with a greeting.\""},"3972":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-102","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#sending-emails","content":"The AI agent will call `send_email` with the appropriate parameters."},"3973":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-103","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#managing-templates","content":"> \"Create an account template called 'Password Reset' with the subject 'Reset your password' and a reset link variable, preview it with sample data, and publish it.\""},"3974":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-104","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#managing-templates","content":"> \"List my templates and tell me which campaigns use 'Monthly newsletter'.\""},"3975":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-105","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#managing-templates","content":"> \"Preview the welcome template with the 'Acme dark' brand.\""},"3976":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-106","pa