nd responses, automatic retries for safe calls, and webhook signature helpers."},"4118":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-23","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option   | Type     | Default    | Description                                                   |\n| -------- | -------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `apiKey` | `string` | *required* | Your NorthRelay API key (`nr_live_`, `nr_test_` or `nr_app_`) |","table":"table-0"},"4119":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-24","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option    | Type     | Default                     | Description                                     |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `baseUrl` | `string` | `https://app.northrelay.ca` | API base URL (HTTPS, no credentials in the URL) |","table":"table-0"},"4120":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-25","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option    | Type     | Default | Description                     |\n| --------- | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `timeout` | `number` | `30000` | Request timeout in milliseconds |","table":"table-0"},"4121":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-26","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option       | Type     | Default | Description                               |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `maxRetries` | `number` | `3`     | Max retry attempts for retryable failures |","table":"table-0"},"4122":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-27","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option       | Type     | Default | Description                                |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `retryDelay` | `number` | `1000`  | Base delay between retries in milliseconds |","table":"table-0"},"4123":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-28","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#responses","content":"Most methods resolve to the API's response envelope, `{ success: true, data }`, so read results from `data`:"},"4124":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-29","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#responses","content":"Contact-list routes return `{ data }` (and `pagination` for lists), and `importCsv` returns the import result directly. The return type of every method says which shape you get."},"4125":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-30","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"See the Mailing Lists guide for the full integration and the Subscriptions API for request and response details."},"4126":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-31","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                             | Endpoint              | Returns `data`    |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `subscriptions.subscribe(request)` | `POST /subscriptions` | `SubscribeResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4127":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-32","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                               | Endpoint                          | Returns `data`      |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.unsubscribe(request)` | `POST /subscriptions/unsubscribe` | `UnsubscribeResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4128":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-33","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                     | Endpoint                     | Returns `data`       |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.get(email)` | `GET /subscriptions/{email}` | `SubscriptionStatus` |","table":"table-1"},"4129":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-34","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                            | Endpoint                       | Returns `data`       |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.updatePreferences(email, request)` | `PATCH /subscriptions/{email}` | `SubscriptionStatus` |","table":"table-1"},"4130":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-35","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                    | Endpoint                                          | Returns `data`             |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.resendConfirmation(email)` | `POST /subscriptions/{email}/resend-confirmation` | `ResendConfirmationResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4131":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-36","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"Emails are URL-encoded in paths for you. `isSubscriptionError(error, code?)` returns `true` for a `NorthRelayError` whose `code` is one of `LIST_NOT_FOUND`, `TOPIC_NOT_FOUND`, `CONTACT_NOT_FOUND`, `CONTACT_BLOCKED`, `RECIPIENT_SUPPRESSED`, `RECIPIENT_UNSUBSCRIBED`, `NO_PENDING_CONFIRMATION`, `FREE_TIER_CONTACT_LIMIT` or `VALIDATION_ERROR` (optionally a specific one). `subscribe` and `resendConfirmation` are never retried automatically, because a retry could send a second confirmation email."},"4132":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-37","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#contacts","content":"`contacts.list()` filters by `status`, `tag`, `search`, `source`, `sortBy` and `sortOrder`. It does not filter by list; use `getListMembers(listId)`. `contacts.create()` does not record consent or fire webhooks; use `subscriptions.subscribe()` when a person signs up."},"4133":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-38","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                          | Endpoint              |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `contacts.listLists({ page, limit, type, isArchived, search })` | `GET /contacts/lists` |","table":"table-2"},"4134":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-39","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                                        | Endpoint                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.getList(id)` / `createList(request)` / `updateList(id, request)` / `deleteList(id)` | `/contacts/lists/{id}` (delete archives) |","table":"table-2"},"4135":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-40","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                 | Endpoint                           |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.getListMembers(id, { page, limit, filter })` | `GET /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4136":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-41","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                  | Endpoint                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.addListMembers(id, { contactIds?, emails?, createMissing? })` | `POST /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4137":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-42","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                     | Endpoint                              |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.removeListMembers(id, { contactIds?, emails? })` | `DELETE /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4138":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-43","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                                | Endpoint                                       |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.addToList(id, contactIdsOrInput)` / `removeFromList(id, contactIdsOrInput)` | Shorthands that accept an array of contact ids |","table":"table-2"},"4139":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-44","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"`removeListMembers` is the list owner removing someone (the membership is deleted). To record that a recipient asked to leave, use `subscriptions.unsubscribe({ email, scope: 'list', listId })`."},"4140":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-45","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#csv-import","content":"`importCsv` accepts a `Blob`/`File` or the CSV text. `mappings` is required."},"4141":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-46","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#topics-suppression-groups","content":"A topic member is an address that **opted out** of that topic."},"4142":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-47","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#topics-suppression-groups","content":"The member methods only edit the opt-out rows. For a recipient's own choice, prefer `subscriptions.unsubscribe({ scope: 'topic', topicId })` or `updatePreferences`, which also update tagged lists and fire webhooks. `bulkAddSuppressions(id, emails)` and `bulkRemoveSuppressions(id, emails)` change up to 10,000 opt-outs at once."},"4143":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-48","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#signup-forms","content":"`forms.submit(id, values)` posts answers keyed by `fieldKey` to a published form. From your own backend, `subscriptions.subscribe()` is usually the better choice."},"4144":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-49","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#webhooks","content":"The webhook routes return their own shapes rather than the `{ success, data }` envelope, as shown above. `create` is not retried automatically. After `rotateSecret`, deliveries also carry `X-NorthRelay-Signature-Previous` (signed with the old secret) until `previousSecretValidUntil`, one hour later. `events` is typed as `WebhookEventType[]`. See Webhook verification for the receiving side."},"4145":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-50","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#suppressions","content":"`reason` is one of `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual`. To record a recipient's own opt-out, prefer `subscriptions.unsubscribe()`."},"4146":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-51","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"Every template is a Studio design. Your dashboard templates use the application key `\"account\"` (`ACCOUNT_APPLICATION`); a product with an `nr_app_` credential uses its own key."},"4147":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-52","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"`templates` and `brandTheme` are deprecated (sunset 30 April 2027). Template ids are design ids, so `emails.send({ templateId })` keeps working."},"4148":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-53","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property | Methods                                                                            |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `emails` | `send`, `sendTemplate`, `schedule`, `cancel`, `validate`, `sendBatch`, `getEvents` |","table":"table-3"},"4149":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-54","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property  | Methods                                                                                                                   |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `designs` | Templates, releases, previews, sends, usage, deliveries, gallery, brands, tracking domains, assets, manifests (see above) |","table":"table-3"},"4150":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-55","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property      | Methods                 |\n| ------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `credentials` | Application credentials |","table":"table-3"},"4151":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-56","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property    | Methods                                                |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `templates` | Deprecated: legacy template API (sunset 30 April 2027) |","table":"table-3"},"4152":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-57","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property    | Methods                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `campaigns` | `create`, `list`, `get`, `update`, `delete`, `preview`, `submit`, `approve`, `reject`, `send`, `getSendStatus` |","table":"table-3"},"4153":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-58","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property  | Methods                                     |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `domains` | `list`, `get`, `create`, `verify`, `delete` |","table":"table-3"},"4154":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-59","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property          | Methods                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `apiKeys`, `keys` | API key management and rotation |","table":"table-3"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-60","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property | Methods                         |\n| -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `events` | `list`, `get`, `getByMessageId` |","table":"table-3"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-61","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property    | Methods                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `analytics` | `query`, `getEngagementHeatmap`, `getGeographic`, `getProviders`, `requestExport`, `getExport` |","table":"table-3"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-62","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property  | Methods             |\n| --------- | ------------------- |\n| `metrics` | `get`, `getSummary` |","table":"table-3"},"4158":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-63","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property     | Methods                                        |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `brandTheme` | Deprecated: use the brand methods on `designs` |","table":"table-3"},"4159":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-64","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"| Property                                                   | Methods                               |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `subusers`, `identity`, `ipPools`, `ips`, `inbox`, `admin` | Account and infrastructure management |","table":"table-3"},"4160":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-65","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"API failures are thrown as `NorthRelayError` or one of its subclasses. Every error carries `code`, `statusCode`, `fixAction` and `docsUrl` when the API supplied them."},"4161":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-66","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class           | When                             | Extra properties |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `AuthenticationError` | Missing or invalid API key (401) | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4162":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-67","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class  | When                                                        | Extra properties |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `ScopeError` | The key lacks the required scope (403 `SCOPE_INSUFFICIENT`) | `requiredScopes` |","table":"table-4"},"4163":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-68","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class       | When                                               | Extra properties   |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `ValidationError` | Request failed validation (400 `VALIDATION_ERROR`) | `validationErrors` |","table":"table-4"},"4164":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-69","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class          | When                   | Extra properties |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `QuotaExceededError` | Monthly quota exceeded | `quota`          |","table":"table-4"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-70","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class      | When                      | Extra properties       |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `RateLimitError` | Rate limit exceeded (429) | `retryAfter` (seconds) |","table":"table-4"},"4166":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-71","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class     | When                     | Extra properties |\n| --------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| `NotFoundError` | Resource not found (404) | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-72","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class   | When                          | Extra properties |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `ServerError` | NorthRelay server error (5xx) | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-73","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class    | When                              | Extra properties |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `NetworkError` | The request did not reach the API | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-74","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#error-handling","content":"| Error class       | When                                                                                                    | Extra properties                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `NorthRelayError` | Any other API error, including the subscription codes (`RECIPIENT_UNSUBSCRIBED`, `LIST_NOT_FOUND`, ...) | `code`, `statusCode`, `fixAction`, `docsUrl` |","table":"table-4"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-75","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#automatic-retries","content":"Read calls and idempotent writes are retried on network errors and HTTP 408, 429, 500, 502, 503 and 504, with exponential backoff from `retryDelay` (capped at 10 seconds) or the `Retry-After` header. Calls that could duplicate a side effect are not retried: `subscriptions.subscribe`, `subscriptions.resendConfirmation`, `contacts.create`, `contacts.bulkCreate`, `contacts.importCsv`, `contacts.createList` and the form create and submit calls."},"4171":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-76","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#webhook-verification","content":"NorthRelay signs each delivery with HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body in the `X-NorthRelay-Signature` header. Verify against the raw body, before parsing it."},"4172":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-77","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#typescript-types","content":"Request, response and webhook types are exported:"},"4173":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-78","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#related","content":"Python SDK for Python integration"},"4174":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-79","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#related","content":"MCP Server for AI agent integration"},"4175":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-80","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#related","content":"Mailing Lists guide"},"4176":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-81","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#related","content":"API